@startuml
title Evidence Processing Pipeline

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Bounded source collection" as Collection {
  component "Node snapshots" as Nodes
  component "Kubernetes snapshot" as Kubernetes
  component "Prometheus snapshot" as Prometheus
}

database "Raw gzip/JSON evidence" as Raw
component "Event normalization\nclassification and fingerprinting" as Normalize
component "Independent scoped 15-minute\ncorrelation episodes" as Correlate
component "Versioned deterministic\nrule evaluation" as Rules
component "Per-check coverage, rule ledger\nand node inventory" as Facts
component "Report assembly" as Report
database "Derived artifacts" as Derived
component "SHA-256 manifest" as Manifest

Nodes --> Raw
Kubernetes --> Raw
Prometheus --> Raw
Raw --> Normalize
Normalize --> Correlate
Correlate --> Rules
Raw --> Rules : Structured state
Raw --> Facts
Rules --> Report : Facts, correlations, hypotheses
Facts --> Report
Facts --> Rules : Unknown / not applicable context
Normalize --> Derived : normalized-events.json.gz
Facts --> Derived : facts.json
Rules --> Derived : findings.json
Report --> Derived : report.json and report.md
Raw --> Manifest
Derived --> Manifest
Manifest --> Derived : manifest.json

note right of Rules
Every rule is matched, not matched, unknown,
or not applicable. Inferred time is never causal.
end note
@enduml
